OL,3,GNEWSAJury discharged in organised crime
OL,4,Agang shooting trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury in the trial of four men and a
OL,7,Fwoman involved in a drug feud that
OL,8,Fended with a pistol being fired outside
OL,9,Fa house in Pyle, near Bridgend, has
OL,10,Fbeen discharged.
OL,12,FKian Darkes, 21, and Daniel Clarke, 21,
OL,13,Fboth from Bridgend, denied possessing a
OL,14,Ffirearm with intent to endanger life.
OL,16,FKyle Long, 40, from Bridgend, and
OL,17,FCallum Pearson, 24, from Cardiff, both
OL,18,Fdenied conspiracy to commit grievous
OL,19,Fbodily harm with intent.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
