OL,3,GNEWSAJury discharged in organised crime
OL,4,Agang shooting trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FJade Evans, 40, from Bridgend, denied
OL,7,Fthree counts of conspiracy to supply a
OL,8,FClass A drug. Darkes, Clarke, Long, and
OL,9,FPearson have been remanded in custody.
